<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>State v. Sanjay, CRL.A. 653/2004</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Justice Ravinder Dudeja</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>2 November 2026</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Appeal</th><td>State appeal under Section 378 CrPC against acquittal of 23 May 2003</td></tr>
